// Title: Prologue: Departure
Alice: The wind today seems somewhat unusual.
    .expression(pensive)
    .wait(400)

Leaves swirl outside the window as the bell tower tolls for the third time.

Alice: Are you ready? We are about to set off.
    .voice(alice_03_ready)

#choice.loop
    * [I'm ready] -> Proceed
    + [Need a bit more time] => WaitMore

=== Proceed ===
  Alice: Then hold my hand tight and stay close, don't let go.
      .expression(smile)
      .sfx(dash)
  -> end

=== WaitMore ===
  Alice: All right, three more minutes to pack your gear. We'll wait right here.
      .expression(neutral)
      .wait(180)
  -> return
